MiOS Hypr3D render quality: MSAA scene buffer (resolved before glass copy,
HUD probe and composite), highp blit with FXAA and AMD FidelityFX CAS,
rotated-grid supersampling of minified window textures, and a
hypr3d.config({ render = { msaa, fxaa, sharpen, texture_supersample } })
section. Applies after hypr3d-mios-glass.patch.

